<section class="gg-ad-landing">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-ad-hero">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower</span>
      <h1>Visible Progress</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower helps you build progress that is visible, steady, and worth returning to. This page is designed to help you try the app and see whether it fits your everyday goals.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/about" class="gg-btn-soft">About Goal Grower</a>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-form-block">
        {% form 'contact', id: 'AwarenessBetaSignup', class: 'gg-landing-form' %}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Goal Grower Beta, Awareness Landing">
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="Beta signup: Awareness landing">
          <div class="gg-form-field">
            <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
            <button type="submit" class="gg-btn">Join Beta Testing</button>
          </div>
        {% endform %}
      </div>

      <div class="gg-hero-meta">
        <span>Visible progress instead of another streak</span>
        <span>Small steps that add up without pressure</span>
        <span>A goal system built for real life</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-trust-line">
        <span>Early access available</span>
        <span>No spam</span>
        <span>Designed for real habits</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-awareness-grid">
      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
          <h2>Visible Progress</h2>
        <p>Your effort becomes a visible signal, so you know when progress is moving forward and when it needs attention.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <h2>Return Easily</h2>
        <p>Goal Grower helps you stay steady without guilt, making it easier to keep momentum week after week.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <h2>Better Habits</h2>
        <p>Choose a system that rewards consistent effort and helps your goals feel motivating instead of overwhelming.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-ad-section">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Get started</span>
      <h2>Join Beta</h2>
      <p>
        If you want a better way to keep progress visible and sustainable, this page is for you. Sign up to test the app and help shape the experience.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join Beta Testing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Awareness",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Goal Grower Awareness" }]
}
{% endschema %}